# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Referrer-Policy: pages that run an audit receive the audited domain through
# ?audit=. boot.js clears it with history.replaceState, but a share link is
# still a URL other people's pages may link to. strict-origin-when-cross-origin
# means a third-party page only ever learns "geoscore.help", never the path or
# query string that carried the audited site.
#
# X-Content-Type-Options: nothing on this site relies on MIME sniffing.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
